{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and pick up. Check properties, perform task, drop off or scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDropOffLocation    /> <Action ID = DropObject    />\"",
